1
00:00:00,386 --> 00:00:01,516
[PENNY GIGGLING OUTSIDE]

2
00:00:01,679 --> 00:00:04,059
PENNY:
Oh, my God, she didn't.

3
00:00:05,433 --> 00:00:07,933
(Leonard:)What could she possibly be talking
about for so long?

4
00:00:08,436 --> 00:00:10,896
(Sheldon:)Obviously, waitressing
at the Cheesecake Factory...

5
00:00:11,064 --> 00:00:13,524
(Sheldon:)...is a complex socio-economic activity...

6
00:00:13,691 --> 00:00:17,441
(Sheldon:)...that requires a great deal
of analysis and planning.

7
00:00:19,489 --> 00:00:21,739
Buzzinga.

8
00:00:22,450 --> 00:00:25,740
(Sheldon:)You know, using positive
reinforcement techniques...

9
00:00:25,912 --> 00:00:28,912
...I could train that behavior out of her
in a week.

10
00:00:29,082 --> 00:00:31,332
(Sheldon:)-No.
-If you let me use negative reinforcement...

11
00:00:31,501 --> 00:00:33,921
(Sheldon:)...I can get it done before we go to bed.

12
00:00:34,087 --> 00:00:36,467
(Leonard:)You're not squirting her in the face
with water.

13
00:00:36,673 --> 00:00:38,593
(Sheldon:)No, of course not.

14
00:00:38,758 --> 00:00:40,758
(Sheldon:)We're talking very mild electric shocks.

15
00:00:41,928 --> 00:00:44,218
(Sheldon:)No tissue damage whatsoever.

16
00:00:44,597 --> 00:00:46,767
(Leonard:)-Forget it.
-Oh, come on.

17
00:00:46,933 --> 00:00:49,393
(Sheldon:)You can't tell me
that you're not intrigued...

18
00:00:49,561 --> 00:00:52,441
(Sheldon:)...about the possibility
of building a better girlfriend.

19
00:00:52,605 --> 00:00:53,895
(Sheldon:)I'm not.

20
00:00:54,065 --> 00:00:57,945
(Leonard:)Penny's qualities, both good and bad,
are what make her who she is.

21
00:00:58,111 --> 00:01:01,451
[PENNY GIGGLING]

